---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const ecosystemHref = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/'}ecosystem`;
---

<Layout title="Profiles & Bundles · DSH Go" description="用一份声明事务化安装 Plugin、MCP、Skill 与 Agent">
  <main class="profiles-page">
    <header>
      <span>DSH 0.1.0 · Registry V3 · API v1</span>
      <h1>Profiles & Bundles</h1>
      <p>把多个生态包组合成可审计、可预检、可重复执行的事务计划。完整依赖图会先完成 Registry 固定 commit、兼容性、冲突和权限检查，再统一提交 Runtime Registry。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-kicker">Reusable environment</div>
        <h2>Profile</h2>
        <p>适合“开发环境 / 数据分析 / Agent 工作台”这类可重复配置。</p>
        <pre><code>{`{
  "name": "developer",
  "packages": [
    { "id": "example-plugin", "version": "0.1.0", "type": "plugin" },
    { "id": "example-skill", "version": "0.1.0", "type": "skill" }
  ]
}`}</code></pre>
        <div class="commands"><code>dsh profile apply developer.json --dry-run</code><code>dsh profile apply developer.json --yes</code></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-kicker">Publisher package set</div>
        <h2>Bundle</h2>
        <p>适合发布者提供“一组必须一起安装”的能力集合。</p>
        <pre><code>{`{
  "name": "agent-stack",
  "packages": [
    { "id": "example-mcp", "version": "0.1.0", "type": "mcp" },
    { "id": "example-agent", "version": "0.1.0", "type": "agent" }
  ]
}`}</code></pre>
        <div class="commands"><code>dsh bundle install agent-stack.json --dry-run</code><code>dsh bundle install agent-stack.json --yes</code></div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="rules">
      <div class="rules-head"><span>Transaction lifecycle</span><h2>事务执行规则</h2><p>先预检完整依赖和权限，再一次性提交；任何预提交失败都不会留下半安装状态。</p></div>
      <ol>
        <li><b>Resolve</b><span>对所有 package 和依赖进行 Registry resolve、OS/Arch/Node/Runtime/Client preflight。</span></li>
        <li><b>Review</b><span>检测 dependencies、conflicts、replaces、provides 和危险权限，并在执行前一次性展示。</span></li>
        <li><b>Dry run</b><span><code>--dry-run</code> 只输出完整依赖计划，不修改本机。</span></li>
        <li><b>Stage</b><span>正式执行先把全部 package 安装到 transaction staging 并验证固定 commit，全部成功后再统一切换。</span></li>
        <li><b>Commit</b><span>Runtime Registry 采用 generation CAS 和本地锁，只在事务提交阶段写入一次。</span></li>
        <li><b>Recover</b><span>任何预提交失败都会恢复原目录；崩溃后的未完成事务由下一次 Startup Loader 自动恢复。</span></li>
        <li><b>Activate</b><span>实际安装不会自动重启客户端；完成后统一提示是否需要手动重启。</span></li>
      </ol>
      <a href={ecosystemHref}>浏览 Ecosystem →</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .profiles-page{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:42px 0 82px}.profiles-page header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:30px}.profiles-page header span,.card-kicker,.rules-head>span{color:var(--accent);font-weight:850;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase}.profiles-page h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,54px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.05;margin:9px 0 12px}.profiles-page header p{max-width:900px;margin:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card,.rules{border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);border-radius:20px;padding:27px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.card h2{font-size:23px;margin:6px 0}.card p,.rules li,.rules-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.65}pre{overflow:auto;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;padding:16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin:16px 0}.commands{display:grid;gap:9px}.commands>code{display:block;padding:11px 12px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;overflow:auto;font-size:12.5px}.rules{margin-top:20px}.rules-head h2{font-size:24px;margin:6px 0}.rules-head p{margin:0 0 16px}.rules ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.rules li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:86px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px}.rules li b{color:var(--fg);font-size:13px}.rules li span{min-width:0}.rules a{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:750}@media(max-width:820px){.profiles-page{padding-top:28px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rules ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:520px){.card,.rules{padding:20px}.rules li{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3px}}
</style>